Three additions, all from user requests

• Launch several apps with one key press — pick the action again to add more. Launches are staggered so each one actually starts; handy against aggressive task killers.
• Tap left/right screen edge: page turns in readers like Storytel, no extra setup.
• D-pad left/right for apps that only listen to arrow keys (needs Shizuku — Android offers apps no other way to send key presses).
